# .gitattributes
#
# CHANGELOG.md diff=markdown — git's built-in "markdown" userdiff driver picks
# heading lines (`## …`) for the `@@ … @@ <funcname>` hunk-header annotation, so
# a human reviewing a diff of a deep `## Unreleased` entry sees which section
# it's under at a glance. This is a READABILITY aid, not a correctness
# dependency: `scripts/check-changelog-entry.mjs` (#380) resolves section
# membership from absolute post-image line numbers, not from this annotation,
# so `pnpm changelog-entry:check` behaves identically with or without this file.
CHANGELOG.md diff=markdown
